   "description": "A 1MHz RC oscillator on a single 5V supply. R6 charges C1 on the inverting input from the paralleled outputs of five 74HC04 inverters, which are driven by Q̄ OUT. Three equal 10k resistors put the non-inverting input between 5V, ground and the inverter outputs, giving the switching thresholds; C2 couples Q OUT onto that node. One output is Q OUT itself and the other a sixth inverter driven from Q OUT. R6 is chosen or trimmed for 1.00MHz.",
